Fig. 1. Preparation process of UF-PSCs. (a) Ultra-ﬂexible polyethylene terephthalate adheres to glass through PDMS; (b) Flat and bubble-free substrate; (c) Deposition
of PEDOT:PSS and PTAA onto the ﬂat substrate in sequence; (d) Deposition of MHP absorption layer; (e) Deposition of PCBM and BCP onto the MHP ﬁlm in sequence;
(f) Peeling off device from the support.

